cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you reference this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Foundations of Computational Interaction"
abstract: >-
  An interdisciplinary research program for formally describing, measuring,
  modeling, and predicting human-computer interaction. A research program, not an
  established independent discipline; its scientific necessity and empirical
  advantage remain to be demonstrated. This deposit packages the versioned
  knowledge system of record (theory 0.5.0) and the C11 reference substrate for a
  deterministic subset of the ontology.
